WEBVTT

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:07.540
<i>It's nothing...</i>

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:11.790
<i>I wasn't myself...</i>

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.160
<i>Maybe because I had</i>

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.160
<i>this weird dream...</i>

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>Yes, it's nothing. Zero's been</i>

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>through so much,</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.700
<i>he must have been confused...</i>

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:26.370
<i>So much...</i>

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:33.540
<i>Until you truly admit it,</i>

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:33.540
<i>I will not speak to you anymore!</i>

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.660
Yuki... What's up with you?

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:39.750
Oh... It's nothing.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.910
We'd better hurry before

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.910
the gate is locked.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.250
Mom...

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:47.040
Are you lost?

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.080
Did you get separated

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.080
from your mother?

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:51.540
Uh-huh...

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.660
Take me to my mom.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:00.540
Yori, I'm going to take him.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:00.540
So can you go on ahead?

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:02.330
Are you sure

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:02.330
you'll be okay alone?

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:05.500
Sure... Okay, let's go.

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.870
You have orders from

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.870
the Hunter's Society.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.080
You're to observe

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.080
tonight's vampire gala.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:19.500
It's a gathering of moderates,

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:19.500
so you shouldn't have any problems.

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:22.700
I understand.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.370
THE ETERNAL PROMISE

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:15.620
We've come quite a distance

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:15.620
from the market,

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:16.790
are you sure it's this way?

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:18.200
Uh-huh...

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:25.200
Shiki... Still not ready yet?

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:26.910
Such a bother...

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.580
I don't like gatherings

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.580
of grown-ups.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:31.450
It can't be helped.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:33.250
Can't you put up with it

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:33.250
for a little while?

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.000
Hanabusa...

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:45.160
Tonight's event is being hosted

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:45.160
by the Aido family, right?

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:49.950
Your father's coming too, isn't he?

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:49.950
Can't you cheer up a little?

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:51.950
That's why I'm not so keen on this.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:59.290
We shall overlook

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:59.290
yesterday's "disturbance."

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.410
And Zero Kiryu shall not

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.410
be dealt with...

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:05.950
As long as you are at

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:05.950
Cross Academy, Lord Kaname...

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:09.040
Thank you, Ichio.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.160
I must say...

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.620
The fair and impartial way

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.620
you vouch

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:16.410
and stand up for your schoolmate

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:16.410
is admirable.

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:19.830
So fitting of the heir to

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:19.830
the Kuran family

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.910
which lay the foundation

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.910
for today's pacifism.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:28.200
Actually...I've been wanting to make

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:28.200
a request of the Senate.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:33.290
Please stay out of the affairs

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:33.290
of Cross Academy from now on.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:39.870
Like my late parents before me,

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:39.870
I do not wish to see bloodshed.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:46.790
Huh?

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:50.540
Hey, are you sure this

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:50.540
is the place?

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.080
Uh-huh...

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:53.830
Thank you, lady.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:56.830
I was really scared by myself.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:01.790
I'm worried, so I'll stay with you

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:01.790
until we find your mom.

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.700
You're really kind, lady.

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:07.580
Huh?

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.250
Oh...

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:14.540
Huh?!

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:20.080
<i>Huh?</i>

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.200
Thank you...

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.080
Hanabusa...

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.410
What is it, Akatsuki?

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:35.580
For some unknown reason,

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:35.580
Yuki Cross is lying here unconscious.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.000
Huh?

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:44.620
Such a troublesome girl.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.040
Huh?

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.080
Oh...

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:56.620
Where am I?

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.250
Huh?

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:03.450
Oh!

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.950
What a relief.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.950
You woke up pretty quickly.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:12.750
Kaname... I...!

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:14.330
Oh...

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:17.540
Yuki...

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:23.410
Thank--!

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:26.790
I thought you didn't

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:26.790
want to talk to me.

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.080
Oh...

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:34.080
That was...just until you acknowledged

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:34.080
that Zero wasn't the culprit...

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:39.620
I told you that I don't intend

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:39.620
to turn him into a criminal.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.870
However, since we don't know

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.870
who the real murderer is,

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.750
I can't make

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.750
a definite statement.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:50.450
Well, I understand that but...

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:53.080
Besides, Yuki...

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:59.160
Did you think I wouldn't get

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:59.160
upset over what you said?

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:02.620
B-But it's your fault, Kaname...

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.370
And do you know who caused that?

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.950
Your heart is beating fast.

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:15.580
Maybe you understand me a little?

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.250
Oh...?

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:19.700
It's fine. Come in.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.200
Ichijo!

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:27.950
Yuki! I'm glad you're awake.

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:31.790
You scared me...

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:31.790
lying in a place like that.

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.700
What happened?

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:38.950
I took a lost child to

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:38.950
an empty-looking building and...

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:41.500
he kissed me on the cheek

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:41.500
as a thank-you.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:43.080
Then...

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:46.370
He must be the son of

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:46.370
one of the guests of the gala.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:49.950
Vampire children can

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:49.950
suck out a person's vitality.

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:55.000
This is the underground villa

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:55.000
of the Aido family,

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:57.200
which was built beneath

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:57.200
that abandoned building.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:01.040
And tonight, the customary gala

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:01.040
for vampires in the area

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.660
is being held here.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:07.160
Many nobles will be in attendance.

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:14.160
I didn't expect to see Ichio

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:14.160
at this gala.

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:17.080
Yes, strange things do happen.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.500
Hanabusa, don't let it

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.500
bother you so much.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.950
A big gala must be observed

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.950
by Hunters.

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:28.000
It's the agreement we made

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:28.000
for keeping peace, remember?

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:30.250
But why him, of all people?!

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:35.660
Hey, Master.

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:37.290
Yo, stupid pupil.

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:39.250
Why are you here?

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.290
I got an order too.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.620
I can handle something

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.620
like this alone.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:46.790
Will you quit touching me?

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.450
Humph... Such a cold pupil.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:53.290
<i>You did not get an order.</i>

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:57.410
Don't worry. It's a gathering of

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:57.410
understanding vampires

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:59.790
who wish to coexist with humans.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:03.160
Your perception has turned

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:03.160
totally dull.

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:08.120
You just sit quietly in that chair

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:08.120
and watch from the sidelines, eh?

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:09.910
Kaien Cross.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.080
It's Ichio.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:16.410
Why would a Senate member

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:16.410
be at this gala?

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.910
It must be due to that incident.

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.580
Understanding vampires, eh?

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:29.700
Do not leave this room

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:29.700
until I return.

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:33.370
I will notify the Headmaster.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:36.540
<i>A room without windows.</i>

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:40.910
<i>Why do I feel like I know</i>

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:40.910
<i>a room like this?</i>

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:44.250
Huh?

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:46.410
What was--?

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:48.910
Oh...huh?!

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:52.870
Human lady,

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:52.870
I'm sorry for what I did earlier.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:56.500
So you were a vampire, huh?

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:57.910
Did you find your mom?

00:09:58.750 --> 00:10:00.160
Oh wait!

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:04.830
Huh?

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:08.950
Oh!

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:11.120
A light?

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:15.790
I knew I shouldn't have come.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:17.790
Senri!

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:21.660
I haven't seen you in awhile,

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:21.660
but my, how you've grown!

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.700
Such a fine young man.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:26.870
It's nice to see you, Granduncle.

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:30.620
But you seem a little thin.

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:32.910
You must eat well.

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.910
Your body is not yours alone.

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:41.410
You should go and visit

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:41.410
your mother sometimes.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.120
See you.

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:10.580
<i>A vampire's gala?</i>

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:15.200
<i>But there are famous actors</i>

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:15.200
<i>and singers too.</i>

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:20.080
<i>And I recognize the president</i>

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:20.080
<i>of a software company too.</i>

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:24.500
<i>Are they all vampires?</i>

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.080
Huh?!

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:34.580
Wh-Why?

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:44.450
<i>Why is Zero...?</i>

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:59.330
Why is Zero here?

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:59.330
He wasn't invited, was he?

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.410
<i>Tonight's assignment</i>

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.410
<i>must be to observe.</i>

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:08.120
<i>Unlike me, Zero's his usual self.</i>

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:10.450
<i>I see...</i>

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.540
<i>So why do I</i>

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.540
<i>keep remembering?!</i>

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.250
I beg your pardon.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.250
I did not mean to interrupt you.

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:36.200
Please continue to enjoy yourselves.

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:41.200
Lord Kaname, is it true that

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:41.200
you defied the Senate...

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.080
and defended a human?

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:44.700
Yes, it is.

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:47.000
Lord Kaname is amazing...

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.330
He wants us to walk

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.330
shoulder to shoulder.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:52.660
For the future of vampires

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:52.660
and humans.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:54.950
What a noble posture to take...

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:00.500
Lord Kaname, thank you for

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:00.500
looking after my son.

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:05.450
Thank you for hosting

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:05.450
this gala, Sir Aido.

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:09.660
I'm not good with gatherings like this,

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:09.660
so I have not attended much.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:11.120
Please don't worry about such a thing.

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:15.660
However, I have a special request.

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:17.290
Tsukiko...

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:19.250
Father!

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:20.790
This is my daughter, Tsukiko.

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:25.250
I hope you will develop a fondness

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:25.250
for her some day.

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.000
That is our family's wish.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.750
Father, please stop!

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:31.200
Lord Kaname, that's not something

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:31.200
I wish for!

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:33.790
I don't know how

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:33.790
things will turn out,

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:34.870
but I shall bear that in mind.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.370
Lord Kaname! Please look favorably

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.370
upon my daughter too.

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:39.950
And my daughter too.

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:41.620
My daughter too.

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:45.370
Lord Kaname, my daughter will

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:45.370
do anything for you.

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:47.620
Lord Kaname has changed.

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:51.000
In the past, he would have

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:51.000
totally ignored such a subject.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:55.910
He understands now the duty

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:55.910
of a rare Pureblood.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.000
Huh?

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:09.330
Ichiru!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.370
Everyone seems surprised.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:19.580
To see you here at

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:19.580
this event, Grandfather.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.620
Hmm? Is something wrong?

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:25.660
No, I was remembering

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:25.660
something trivial.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:27.160
Huh?

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:30.450
Death will come calling to

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:30.450
one who sees his other self.

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:35.580
A silly myth passed down by humans.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:39.830
Hello, Zero.

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:42.910
What are you doing in

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:42.910
a place like this?

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:45.450
You're looking well.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:49.950
I thought you'd have lapsed

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:49.950
into Level E by this time.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.580
Ichiru, we're leaving.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:56.290
You will see Ichio home.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:57.950
Yes.

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:08.830
Ichiru, you...!

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:11.330
I'm employed by the Senate.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:14.450
So we may just meet again somewhere.

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:17.290
Oh, by the way, Zero.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.910
Have you heard of

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.910
the "Cursed Twins"?

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:21.790
What're you talking about?

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:23.790
It seems you haven't.

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:25.700
Never mind then.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.830
<i>I knew there was</i>

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.830
<i>a big gap between us.</i>

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:42.540
<i>But I wish I hadn't seen that.</i>

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:46.160
Can I come in?

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:47.830
Huh?

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:48.910
Oh...yes!

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:57.250
Didn't I tell you not to

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:57.250
leave this room?

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.910
I-I'm sorry.

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:08.330
Huh? Oh...

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:12.790
No, I won't forgive you...

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:12.790
with just an apology.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.200
Oh...

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.950
Why did you leave?

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:28.950
The boy...the boy who was lost...

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.290
I was worried if

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.290
he found his mother...

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:34.790
Let's go.

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:36.410
Okay, Mom!

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:41.700
I see... That Ichiru, huh.

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:44.830
In any case,

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:44.830
don't do anything reckless.

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:47.250
Don't do anything that

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:49.500
will make that small

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:49.500
Disciplinary Committee worry.

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:52.410
She's not small.

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:59.500
To me, her existence is not small.

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:11.790
Kaname...?

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:13.750
Until I forgive you...

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:16.000
For just a little longer...

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:16.000
stay like this.

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:18.120
I'm tired.

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:27.620
Of course. I'll do anything...

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:27.620
for you, Lord Kaname.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:42.200
<i>I love you, Lord Kaname.</i>

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:45.620
<i>You are the start of my world.</i>

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.450
<i>That's why even though</i>

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.450
<i>my past was an empty shell,</i>

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:49.580
<i>I wasn't afraid.</i>

00:17:58.330 --> 00:17:59.330
Yuki...

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:02.330
I had decided not to call

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:02.330
you "Lord Kaname,"

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:04.250
when I was face to face with you...

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:07.410
But we're no longer in the past,

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:08.870
when I didn't know anything...

00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:15.910
I kept telling myself that you were

00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:15.910
far beyond my reach now...

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:22.580
That what mattered was that

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:22.580
I never forget your kindness...

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:24.700
And yet...!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.080
Oh...

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.160
Kaname?

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:51.370
To "us," you are all

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:51.370
fleeting living creatures

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:55.450
who pass through our lives

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:55.450
for an instant.

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:59.370
Do you want to become

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:59.370
a vampire?

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:06.250
Do you want to become

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:06.250
a blood-sucking beast like me...

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:10.910
...and live a long, long life together?

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:16.040
Yes...

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:33.200
Sorry.

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:36.200
This punishment is too excessive.

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:36.200
I won't do anything.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.580
I'm sorry if I frightened you.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:49.700
Kaname, I...

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.450
Why must you look like that?

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:55.080
Learn from this and

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:58.620
don't go walking into dangerous

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:58.620
situations again, that's all.

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:02.250
It's time you returned home.

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:06.910
Welcome back, Yuki.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:10.580
Yori, I'm back.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:10.580
I'm sorry I made you worry.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:14.500
Oh...

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:15.580
Snow...?

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:22.250
The whiteness of snow brings

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:22.250
back memories of crimson blood.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:26.950
Of ten years ago and

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:26.950
the red that splattered.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:30.040
Of the beautiful boy upon

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:30.040
whom the blood spattered,

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.000
who reached his hand out to me.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:35.580
I took that hand...

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:41.750
If Kaname was near,

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:41.750
I had nothing to fear.

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:45.790
If it was for Kaname, I would do anything.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:53.080
Do you want to live a long,

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:53.080
long life together?

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:56.450
How I longed to hear those words...

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:59.750
Those words which I had

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:59.750
resigned to never hear.

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:03.830
So many thoughts became

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:03.830
entangled in my mind

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:05.370
and turned to tears flowing

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:05.370
down my cheeks.

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:12.450
Even if you didn't mean

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:12.450
any of it, Kaname...

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:16.790
After seeing me, unable to act

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:16.790
after talking so boldly...

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:19.080
Were you disappointed?

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:32.000
It's almost vacation.

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:35.000
We won't be able to see

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:35.000
Idol for so long!

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:37.500
I don't want that, Wild!

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:41.000
Ruka, there is a fire in

00:21:37.580 --> 00:21:41.000
my heart that I must...

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:42.080
Shut up!

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:44.000
Zero!

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:46.910
Quit daydreaming and do your work!

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:50.000
Oh, sorry.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:59.910
All right, everyone! Get back!

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:01.830
Ruka!

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:08.950
I know that the things

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:08.950
you told me weren't lies.

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:13.120
So don't worry.

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:04.830
Next time:

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:04.830
"The Azure Portrait"
